WEBVTT

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:29.172
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Locanda Verde. Good morning. How can I help you?

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.210
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Hello. A table for tomorrow, please.

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:37.177
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Tomorrow… er, Tuesday?

00:00:37.649 --> 00:00:38.692
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:40.185
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> How many people?

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:41.437
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Three.

00:00:44.329 --> 00:00:44.917
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> What time?

00:00:46.431 --> 00:00:47.447
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Seven o’clock.

00:00:50.822 --> 00:00:51.960
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> What’s your name, please?

00:00:53.122 --> 00:01:03.774
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Jenny Zielinski. That’s Z-I-E-L-I-N-S-K-I.

00:01:05.629 --> 00:01:09.173
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Thank you, Ms, er, Zielinski.

00:01:09.608 --> 00:01:10.399
OK.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:15.167
So, a table for three on Tuesday at seven.

00:01:15.858 --> 00:01:17.895
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Great. Thanks. Bye.

00:01:18.509 --> 00:01:20.403
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Goodbye, see you tomorrow.